  "definition": "Training Program Approval",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-07-22",
  "historyNote": "#10420, eff 9-25-13; ss by #12334, eff 7-22-17 (formerly Elec 306.01) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300); renumbered by #13866 (formerly Elec 307.01) (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
